    "language": "json",
    "promptTemplate": "下面是某店铺的 10 条订单原始流水（订单号,下单日期,用户ID,数量,单价）：\n\nA-1041,2026-03-04,u1,2,19.5\nA-1042,2026-03-04,u2,1,128.0\nA-1043,2026-03-02,u1,3,7.25\nA-1044,2026-03-01,u3,5,3.4\nA-1045,2026-02-28,u2,1,999.99\nA-1046,2026-02-27,u1,4,12.5\nA-1047,2026-02-27,u3,2,56.75\nA-1048,2026-02-25,u2,6,2.15\nA-1049,2026-02-24,u1,1,340.0\nA-1050,2026-02-20,u3,3,18.9\n\n用户表：u1=张三，u2=李四，u3=王五。\n\n请输出一个 JSON 对象，顶层键**恰好**为 generatedAt、users、orders、summary（不得多也不得少）：\n1. generatedAt：ISO 8601 日期时间字符串\n2. users：恰好 3 个元素，每个元素**恰好**含 id、name 两个键\n3. orders：恰好 10 个元素，每个元素**恰好**含 id、date、userId、qty、unitPrice、amount、tax、total 八个键，且键的出现顺序必须与上述一致\n   - amount = qty × unitPrice，四舍五入到 2 位小数\n   - tax = amount × 0.06，四舍五入到 2 位小数\n   - total = amount + tax（保留到分）\n   - 数组必须按 date 降序排列；date 相同时按 id 升序排列\n4. summary：**恰好**含 count、itemsTotal、taxTotal、grandTotal 四个键\n   - itemsTotal = 所有 amount 之和，taxTotal = 所有 tax 之和，grandTotal = 所有 total 之和\n5. orders 中每个 userId 都必须存在于 users 的 id 中\n6. 输出纯 JSON，不要 markdown 代码块，不要任何解释文字",
    "requirements": {
      "format": "json",
      "output_policy": "raw_only",
      "requiredFields": [
        "generatedAt",
        "users",
        "orders",
        "summary",
        "summary.count",
        "summary.itemsTotal",
        "summary.taxTotal",
        "summary.grandTotal",
        "orders[0].amount",
        "orders[0].tax",
        "orders[0].total"
      ],
      "constraints": [
        "keys:.=generatedAt,users,orders,summary",
        "keysAll:orders[]=id,date,userId,qty,unitPrice,amount,tax,total",
        "keyOrder:orders[0]=id,date,userId,qty,unitPrice,amount,tax,total",
        "keysAll:users[]=id,name",
        "unique:orders[].id",
        "unique:users[].id",
        "sorted:orders[]=date:desc,id:asc",
        "reAll:orders[].id:^A-\\d{4}$",
        "reAll:orders[].date:^\\d{4}-\\d{2}-\\d{2}$",
        "ref:orders[].userId in users[].id",
        "productEq:orders[].amount=qty*unitPrice:2",
        "ratioEq:orders[].tax=amount*0.06:2",
        "maxDecimals:orders[].total=2",
        "length:orders=10",
