    "id": "SO-CN-047",
    "category": "json",
    "difficulty": "adversarial",
    "language": "json",
    "promptTemplate": "请输出一个 JSON 对象，顶层键**恰好**为 schema、config 两个，任何层级都**不得出现未声明的键**。\n\nconfig 描述「多环境部署配置」，其键**恰好**为 service、version、environments 三个：\n1. service：非空字符串；version：形如 1.2.3 的字符串\n2. environments：**恰好**含 dev、staging、prod 三个键\n3. dev / staging / prod 每个的值**恰好**含 replicas、image、env、resources 四个键\n4. replicas 为整数：dev 必须为 1，staging 必须为 2，prod 必须不小于 3\n5. image 为含冒号 tag 的字符串\n6. env **恰好**含 4 个键，键名为大写字母加下划线形式（如 DB_HOST、LOG_LEVEL）\n7. resources **恰好**含 cpu、memory 两个键，取值为字符串\n8. schema 必须在同一文档内描述上述全部约束（含 additionalProperties 为 false、pattern、enum、required、replicas 的整数上下界），且 config 必须满足 schema\n9. 输出纯 JSON，不要 markdown 代码块，不要任何解释文字",
    "requirements": {
      "format": "json",
      "output_policy": "raw_only",
      "requiredFields": [
        "schema",
        "config",
        "config.environments",
        "config.environments.prod.replicas"
      ],
      "constraints": [
        "keys:.=schema,config",
        "keys:config=service,version,environments",
        "length:config.environments=3",
        "keys:config.environments=dev,staging,prod",
        "keys:config.environments.dev=replicas,image,env,resources",
        "keys:config.environments.staging=replicas,image,env,resources",
        "keys:config.environments.prod=replicas,image,env,resources",
        "length:config.environments.dev.env=4",
        "length:config.environments.staging.env=4",
        "length:config.environments.prod.env=4",
        "keys:config.environments.prod.resources=cpu,memory",
        "type:config.environments.prod.replicas=number",
        "schemaValidates:schema:config",
        "type:schema.additionalProperties=boolean",
        "valueEq:schema.additionalProperties=false"
      ],
      "axis_weights": {
        "syntax_parse": 0.05,
        "schema_compliance": 0.1,
        "field_constraints": 0.55,
        "cross_field_consistency": 0.1,
        "output_discipline": 0.15
      }
    },
